  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Version 10.0.3 - Security, Performance & Diagnostics\n\n🔒 SECURITY:\n- FilterExpressionBuilder: Field name validation (alphanumeric + dot only)\n- FilterExpressionBuilder: Invalid operator now throws ArgumentException instead of silent bypass\n- FilterExpressionBuilder: Unknown property returns false (safe default) instead of true\n- Soft delete bypass methods restricted to internal access\n\n⚡ PERFORMANCE:\n- Fixed memory leak: removed unnecessary scope creation in UnitOfWork repository resolution\n- AuditInterceptor: PropertyInfo reflection results cached via ConcurrentDictionary\n- IdGenerationInterceptor: Type hierarchy and PropertyInfo cached, boxing optimization for common types\n- DomainEventDispatcher: Events dispatched sequentially for correct ordering (handlers still parallel)\n- Removed unused PerformCacheMaintenance dead code\n\n🐛 BUG FIXES:\n- SingleOrDefaultAsync<TResult> now correctly calls SingleOrDefaultAsync instead of SingleAsync\n- BulkDeleteAsync uses ISoftDelete interface check instead of fragile reflection\n\n📊 NEW: Production Diagnostics (opt-in)\n- OpenTelemetry-compatible metrics via System.Diagnostics.Metrics\n- Repository operation counters, error counters, and duration histograms\n- UnitOfWork save/transaction/cache metrics\n- Interceptor and domain event metrics\n- Enable via .WithMetrics() in fluent configuration",
